OL,3,GNEWSA'Highly respected' council chief  
OL,4,Aexecutive dies                         
OL,6,FA chief executive who led a local      
OL,7,Fauthority in Surrey through "an        
OL,8,Fexceptionally difficult time" has died,
OL,9,Fthe council leader has said.           
OL,11,FRichard Carr, chief executive of Woking
OL,12,FBorough Council, took on the leadership
OL,13,Frole after being appointed to help the 
OL,14,Fauthority tackle debts of #2bn.        
OL,16,FFollowing his death, council leader    
OL,17,FAnn-Marie Barker said: "This is        
OL,18,Fincredibly sad news. Richard was a     
OL,19,Fhighly respected chief executive, a    
OL,20,Fdedicated public servant and a trusted 
OL,21,Fand valued colleague."                 
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
