OL,3,GNEWSA'Highly respected' council chief  
OL,4,Aexecutive dies                         
OL,6,FShe said the thoughts of those at the  
OL,7,Fcouncil were with his family and       
OL,8,Ffriends, adding: "His contribution to  
OL,9,FWoking will not be forgotten."         
